  "PP-OCRv6_medium_rec has no Cyrillic in its dictionary (measured: not one entry contains a codepoint in U+0400..U+04FF), so five Cyrillic types cannot be trained with this checkpoint at all.",
  "The four held-out types without a band are evaluated on the whole frame, exactly like the previous run and the archived bench, so the pipeline is identical.",
  "The held-out split is by WHOLE PLUGINS (5 plugins, 7 types); no image of a held-out type is ever seen in training.",
  "The evaluation during the run covered the 7 held-out types only (--eval-types); the 13 trained types were not re-evaluated every epoch, which is why the run fits the budget."
